WEBVTT

01:01.810 --> 01:06.060
<i><b>The Daywalker and the Mutant</b></i>

01:08.980 --> 01:11.230
<b><i>Don't got a lotta good
memories on this island.</i></b>

01:12.320 --> 01:15.990
<b><i>I was hoping I'd never have
to come here again.</i></b>

01:17.240 --> 01:17.780
<b><i>But...</i></b>

01:18.950 --> 01:21.010
<b><i>looks like that ain't the case.</i></b>

01:24.160 --> 01:27.750
<b><i>This is an island where the people
don't even fear vampires.</i></b>

01:28.630 --> 01:33.760
<b><i>I must be on a bad luck streak
to have ended up in this hellhole.</i></b>

01:35.670 --> 01:39.550
<b>Is this the package that
old man Noah sent?</b>

01:42.010 --> 01:43.810
<b>Hey, somebody's shot!</b>

01:44.430 --> 01:45.560
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

01:45.560 --> 01:47.810
<b>Just an argument being settled.</b>

01:51.570 --> 01:52.270
<b>Seriously?</b>

01:53.320 --> 01:56.110
<b>You sure you should be unloading
that out in the open?</b>

01:58.450 --> 02:00.620
<b><i>This is Madripoor.</i></b>

02:00.620 --> 02:02.540
<b><i>A lawless island.</i></b>

02:03.580 --> 02:05.580
<b><i>No cops, not even any military.</i></b>

02:19.640 --> 02:22.010
<b>This place is as big of
a scumhole as ever.</b>

02:23.510 --> 02:24.970
<b>What the hell was that!?</b>

02:25.680 --> 02:27.730
<b>It's just the welcome wagon.</b>

02:27.730 --> 02:29.350
<b>You know who did this?</b>

02:29.850 --> 02:31.980
<b>Someone trying to ice skate uphill.</b>

02:33.730 --> 02:35.990
<b>...my fault for asking.</b>

02:43.160 --> 02:44.030
<b>Motherfucker!</b>

03:00.050 --> 03:02.430
<b>Did Deacon Frost hire you!?</b>

03:02.600 --> 03:05.430
<b>You working for A.I.M.!?</b>

03:05.600 --> 03:06.810
<b>Answer me, Logan! Answer me, Blade!</b>

03:09.480 --> 03:10.020
<b>What's up with that?</b>

03:10.020 --> 03:12.400
<b>I thought we were after one guy.</b>

03:12.400 --> 03:13.310
<b>What's going on?</b>

03:14.610 --> 03:16.320
<b>You recognize them?</b>

03:16.320 --> 03:17.110
<b>Nope.</b>

03:17.110 --> 03:18.570
<b>Take them both!</b>

03:26.160 --> 03:27.620
<b>You don't wanna die...</b>

03:28.080 --> 03:29.500
<b>...so buzz off.</b>

03:31.040 --> 03:31.920
<b>Damn it!</b>

03:31.920 --> 03:33.330
<b>You guys are gonna pay for this!</b>

03:33.330 --> 03:34.880
<b>What did they want?</b>

03:35.040 --> 03:36.420
<b>Mother Mantis...</b>

03:37.210 --> 03:39.090
<b>They're a gang from Lowtown.</b>

03:39.840 --> 03:41.220
<b>You tick them off?</b>

03:41.880 --> 03:43.890
<b>I just got here.</b>

03:44.140 --> 03:46.060
<b>And you're already blowing stuff up...</b>

03:46.720 --> 03:48.100
<b>you hurt?</b>

03:48.100 --> 03:49.100
<b>Just scratched.</b>

03:49.100 --> 03:50.310
<b>It'll heal.</b>

03:50.310 --> 03:52.190
<b>Maybe not as fast as
it would for you, though.</b>

03:52.850 --> 03:55.560
<b>You know Blade?</b>

03:55.560 --> 03:56.440
<b>Indeed.</b>

03:56.440 --> 04:00.400
<b>Those were some nice
kicks you had there, girlie.</b>

04:01.280 --> 04:02.200
<b>The name is Makoto.</b>

04:02.200 --> 04:02.950
<b>Who're you?</b>

04:03.450 --> 04:04.370
<b>Logan.</b>

04:05.070 --> 04:08.790
<b>I've had a few run-ins with Blade here...</b>

04:08.790 --> 04:09.950
<b>how long's it been?</b>

04:10.870 --> 04:11.910
<b>Don't remember.</b>

04:14.040 --> 04:16.130
<b>You never change, bub.</b>

04:45.240 --> 04:46.070
<b>See?</b>

04:46.070 --> 04:47.950
<b>Nice quality, right?</b>

04:47.950 --> 04:53.580
<b>When it comes to weapons manufacturing,
no one on this island can match us.</b>

04:54.040 --> 04:56.920
<b>You're gonna be fighting
the fancy guys, right?</b>

04:56.920 --> 05:00.500
<b>Still, needing silver bullets...</b>

05:00.500 --> 05:03.840
<b>vampires are pretty luxurious,
for freaks.</b>

05:04.720 --> 05:05.550
<b>Jararl...</b>

05:06.140 --> 05:08.850
<b>I hear you couldn't
manage to kill Blade.</b>

05:09.010 --> 05:11.520
<b>He won't get away next time.</b>

05:11.520 --> 05:17.520
<b>After all, once I've killed Blade
and set you all up with weapons,</b>

05:17.520 --> 05:20.090
<b>I get to live forever, right?</b>

05:20.770 --> 05:23.530
<b>Lord Frost should learn
to be more frugal;</b>

05:23.530 --> 05:28.990
<b>offering to turn such a filthy human,
who knows no servitude, into one of our kind...</b>

05:29.280 --> 05:34.330
<b>Listen, Mr. Sergei, I wanna help
Mr. Frost with his agenda.</b>

05:35.000 --> 05:38.000
<b>And I want what you vampires got!</b>

05:38.460 --> 05:40.290
<b>After I take over this island,</b>

05:40.290 --> 05:45.130
<b>I'll team up with you all and
we'll slaughter those "noble" guys.</b>

05:46.680 --> 05:48.010
<b>Whoa, scary!</b>

05:51.680 --> 05:55.390
<b>But have you forgotten the kind
weapons we're producing here?</b>

05:57.560 --> 05:59.520
<b>Put the fangs away,</b>

05:59.520 --> 06:04.360
<b>or you're gonna see how well
these silver bullets work first-hand.</b>

06:09.820 --> 06:10.850
<b>Much better.</b>

06:11.370 --> 06:13.290
<b>I'm not one of your goons;</b>

06:13.290 --> 06:16.370
<b>I'm motherfucking Jararl and
we're partners on equal footing.</b>

06:18.210 --> 06:20.630
<b>A gift, from Lord Frost.</b>

06:21.340 --> 06:28.180
<b>It's a Polong, a breed of vampire from Malaysia,
that he has genetically enhanced.</b>

06:28.930 --> 06:33.390
<b>Feed it some human blood,
and it'll follow your every command.</b>

06:33.930 --> 06:36.520
<b>You better appreciate this, human.</b>

06:36.520 --> 06:38.980
<b>Blade's going to be
targeting this factory.</b>

06:38.980 --> 06:40.900
<b>Make sure you kill him this time.</b>

06:42.560 --> 06:43.770
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

06:46.650 --> 06:49.070
<b><i>I'm not gonna fuck this chance up...</i></b>

06:50.320 --> 06:54.450
<b><i>I'm going to make my way out of Lowtown,
into Hightown...</i></b>

06:55.580 --> 06:57.160
<b><i>into the Dragon Palace...</i></b>

07:09.840 --> 07:10.680
<b>What's wrong?</b>

07:10.680 --> 07:11.590
<b>Not gonna eat?</b>

07:13.010 --> 07:15.810
<b>Takes a little getting used to,
but it ain't half bad.</b>

07:27.530 --> 07:28.990
<b>Nice and crunchy...</b>

07:34.070 --> 07:35.830
<b>It don't taste half bad.</b>

07:35.830 --> 07:36.870
<b>Not moldy or nothing.</b>

07:38.950 --> 07:40.620
<b>I think I'll pass...</b>

07:41.920 --> 07:44.670
<b>So, what brings you to this island?</b>

07:45.210 --> 07:47.170
<b>Advanced Idea Mechanics...</b>

07:48.130 --> 07:49.340
<b>better known as A.I.M.</b>

07:50.380 --> 07:53.800
<b>They're a worldwide buncha crooks,
and I followed them here.</b>

07:53.800 --> 07:57.560
<b>Seems like the perfect place for a weirdly
named criminal organization.</b>

07:58.140 --> 08:03.100
<b>Yeah, something about this hole
tends to draw rats to it.</b>

08:03.100 --> 08:05.060
<b>From what I've been hearing...</b>

08:05.860 --> 08:11.070
<b>A.I.M. has been dealing a hell of a lot
of weapons around Madripoor.</b>

08:11.990 --> 08:16.410
<b>I lost someone real important
to me because of them...</b>

08:16.410 --> 08:18.040
<b>they're gonna pay.</b>

08:24.000 --> 08:25.130
<b>Did you find anything out?</b>

08:26.920 --> 08:30.710
<b>A few blocks from here,
there's an off-shore hideout for a gang.</b>

08:30.710 --> 08:35.640
<b>Their factory's received a ton of silver,
shipped from Sumatra...</b>

08:36.350 --> 08:43.270
<b>I'm guessing that Existence is on
the warpath against the purebloods.</b>

08:43.270 --> 08:47.650
<b>Looks like we both got
a bunch of dirtbags to carve up.</b>

08:49.860 --> 08:51.260
<b>So, Blade...</b>

08:51.990 --> 08:52.690
<b>What?</b>

08:53.820 --> 08:55.070
<b>This your sweetheart?</b>

08:56.320 --> 08:58.280
<b>W-What...</b>

08:58.490 --> 09:00.950
<b>hell no, I'm not!</b>

09:03.750 --> 09:05.210
<b>Well, what do you say?</b>

09:08.420 --> 09:09.880
<b>Makoto's my partner.</b>

09:12.550 --> 09:13.670
<b>That's right!</b>

09:13.670 --> 09:15.840
<b>Partners, man, partners...</b>

09:15.840 --> 09:18.140
<b>Aw, really?</b>

09:18.140 --> 09:19.850
<b>I just assumed...</b>

09:19.850 --> 09:20.760
<b>Assumed what!?</b>

09:21.640 --> 09:26.140
<b>Fair enough, but I bet she's
not just your partner, right?</b>

09:27.310 --> 09:28.060
<b>You're right.</b>

09:30.400 --> 09:31.980
<b>She's a partner I can trust.</b>

09:35.950 --> 09:36.910
<b>That how it is, eh?</b>

09:36.910 --> 09:38.530
<b>I don't see what's so funny.</b>

09:38.530 --> 09:41.540
<b>Just thinking about
how you never change.</b>

09:41.540 --> 09:43.330
<b>Must be rough, eh, girlie?</b>

09:43.330 --> 09:44.580
<b>W-What's that supposed to mean?</b>

09:46.290 --> 09:47.080
<b>A whole buncha different things!</b>

09:47.080 --> 09:48.790
<b>Like what!?</b>

09:48.790 --> 09:50.710
<b>Look darlin', I'm not gonna
spell it out for you!</b>

09:56.130 --> 09:57.220
<b>Listen up!</b>

09:57.220 --> 09:58.470
<b>Leave Blade to me!</b>

09:58.970 --> 10:01.180
<b>You all handle the small-fry!</b>

10:01.180 --> 10:02.180
<b>Right!</b>

10:09.100 --> 10:13.530
<b><i>I swear, I'm going to make
my way up from Lowtown,</i></b>

10:13.530 --> 10:15.990
<b><i>and teach those bastards
in Hightown who I am!</i></b>

10:16.900 --> 10:18.410
<b><i>Just wait...</i></b>

10:18.410 --> 10:20.780
<b><i>this island's gonna be mine!</i></b>

10:25.790 --> 10:27.290
<b>Come on out...</b>

10:27.290 --> 10:29.630
<b>let's see how useful you can be.</b>

11:11.250 --> 11:13.290
<b>The Daywalker...</b>

11:13.290 --> 11:15.000
<b>must be rough.</b>

11:16.000 --> 11:17.920
<b>You worried about him, girlie?</b>

11:18.800 --> 11:19.900
<b>I guess.</b>

11:20.840 --> 11:25.640
<b>Well, I'm kinda in the same boat...</b>

11:27.140 --> 11:28.560
<b>I'm a mutant.</b>

11:33.020 --> 11:36.110
<b>And in spite of the bucket of
trouble that comes with that,</b>

11:36.110 --> 11:39.360
<b>I tried to make the girl I loved happy...</b>

11:41.360 --> 11:44.910
<b>but the trouble never seems to let up.</b>

11:46.080 --> 11:49.830
<b>So make sure you look
out for him, girlie.</b>

11:51.790 --> 11:52.810
<b>I...</b>

11:54.420 --> 11:56.820
<b>I don't know what I could do...</b>

11:59.550 --> 12:01.590
<b>Just being with him's plenty.</b>

12:02.840 --> 12:04.180
<b>More than enough.</b>

12:05.220 --> 12:06.100
<b>Nah...</b>

12:06.100 --> 12:09.270
<b>I'm pretty sure that's
the best thing you could do.</b>

12:15.560 --> 12:16.270
<b>This smell!</b>

12:19.780 --> 12:20.740
<b>What is it?</b>

12:20.740 --> 12:22.820
<b>You okay?</b>

12:22.820 --> 12:23.530
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:24.490 --> 12:28.080
<b>Looks like we got visitors...</b>

12:57.860 --> 13:02.150
<b>What's a pureblood want
with us in Existence?</b>

13:02.150 --> 13:03.400
<b>Mr. Sergei...</b>

13:03.400 --> 13:04.150
<b>Hold it.</b>

13:07.950 --> 13:12.450
<b>I happen to be one of the legendary
Russian vampires, an Upyr.</b>

13:16.290 --> 13:19.090
<b>And nothing you can do
can hurt my steel body!</b>

13:39.860 --> 13:41.110
<b>We're worse off in here...</b>

13:41.110 --> 13:41.820
<b>What do we do!?</b>

13:41.820 --> 13:42.780
<b>Let's get outside.</b>

13:46.950 --> 13:47.990
<b>You okay?</b>

13:47.990 --> 13:48.660
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:49.660 --> 13:51.200
<b>I'll take the mangy dogs!</b>

13:52.040 --> 13:53.410
<b>You handle the flying shrimp!</b>

14:09.970 --> 14:11.950
<b>Hey there, Blade.</b>

14:12.220 --> 14:16.020
<b>I'm the boss of Mother Mantis,
motherfucking Jararl.</b>

14:16.020 --> 14:19.650
<b>Those polong things
help you warm up?</b>

14:20.690 --> 14:23.820
<b>You're not gonna lay
a finger on my factory.</b>

14:23.820 --> 14:26.110
<b>As long as you stay out of my way,</b>

14:26.570 --> 14:30.030
<b>Frost is going to provide me
with immortality.</b>

14:31.580 --> 14:34.160
<b>Sorry, but you've got to die.</b>

14:36.160 --> 14:39.120
<b>Why would you abandon
your humanity?</b>

14:39.710 --> 14:42.250
<b>Because I wanna rule this island.</b>

14:42.250 --> 14:43.550
<b>It's simple.</b>

14:43.550 --> 14:47.970
<b>Human or freak,
doesn't really matter to me.</b>

14:48.340 --> 14:49.630
<b>Bullshit...</b>

14:50.260 --> 14:53.140
<b>you know damn well they're
not gonna honor your bargain.</b>

14:53.140 --> 14:56.220
<b>Hey, anything can happen
on this island!</b>

14:56.220 --> 14:58.850
<b>Now imagine a vampire
running the show!</b>

14:58.850 --> 15:00.350
<b>Pretty sweet, huh?</b>

15:20.250 --> 15:21.880
<b>Well, now...</b>

15:21.880 --> 15:25.380
<b>this is a quantity much greater
than I had heard about.</b>

15:26.000 --> 15:32.390
<b>I see it would be wise to rouse Frost from
his dream as quickly as possible.</b>

15:46.230 --> 15:47.230
<b>Give it up!</b>

15:48.990 --> 15:51.860
<b>You're gonna regret
dragging me into this mess...</b>

16:10.800 --> 16:12.220
<b>What's the matter Blade?</b>

16:12.680 --> 16:15.300
<b>That pig sticker of yours
isn't just a toy, right?</b>

16:16.050 --> 16:18.810
<b>I don't have any weapons that
I use on humans.</b>

16:19.600 --> 16:20.770
<b>Dumbass...</b>

16:20.770 --> 16:22.310
<b>trying to act cool?</b>

16:23.400 --> 16:26.190
<b>Think about how lucky
you were to be born human.</b>

16:27.190 --> 16:30.860
<b>Where you're headed,
there's nothing but darkness.</b>

16:30.860 --> 16:32.400
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

16:33.110 --> 16:35.660
<b>You're a freak yourself!</b>

16:35.660 --> 16:37.910
<b>What do you know about me!?</b>

16:42.040 --> 16:42.830
<b>It can't be!</b>

16:56.470 --> 16:57.640
<b>My...</b>

16:57.640 --> 16:59.600
<b>my factory...</b>

17:04.730 --> 17:06.350
<b>Dammit, you!</b>

17:12.610 --> 17:15.570
<b>You having fun watching
the fire, asshole!?</b>

17:25.250 --> 17:29.250
<b>He did a fine job, for a human,
but that ends now.</b>

17:29.840 --> 17:32.760
<b>Good evening, Mr. Daywalker.</b>

17:37.640 --> 17:38.970
<b>What do you want?</b>

17:39.600 --> 17:45.850
<b>I was hoping to watch the conflict
between you and Frost play out more,</b>

17:45.850 --> 17:48.730
<b>but in all societies,
there must be order.</b>

17:49.560 --> 17:52.980
<b>Frost has overstepped
himself in that regard.</b>

17:53.690 --> 17:57.360
<b>Before Frost can claim
your power for his own,</b>

17:57.360 --> 18:03.500
<b>I, as one who governs the night,
will see to it that you die.</b>

18:04.200 --> 18:06.160
<b>Fuck off, pureblood!</b>

18:10.460 --> 18:13.710
<b>The Daywalker will not
see another dawn!</b>

18:16.340 --> 18:17.970
<b>This is the end...</b>

18:18.300 --> 18:21.350
<b>Right back at ya, bub!</b>

18:24.060 --> 18:26.060
<b>How do you find my blade?</b>

18:31.400 --> 18:33.820
<b>For a minute there,
I thought I was dead.</b>

18:34.320 --> 18:35.440
<b>You...</b>

18:35.440 --> 18:36.240
<b>you're a mutant!?</b>

19:08.560 --> 19:09.440
<b>Impossible...</b>

19:10.440 --> 19:12.560
<b>a pureblood, such as myself!?</b>

19:13.110 --> 19:15.190
<b>Humans...</b>

19:15.190 --> 19:17.320
<b>don't die that easily...</b>

19:17.780 --> 19:20.070
<b>Serves you right, vampire...</b>

19:20.450 --> 19:23.910
<b>To lay hands on a pureblood
such as myself...</b>

19:23.910 --> 19:27.080
<b>do you realize what you've done!?</b>

19:28.120 --> 19:30.290
<b>You imbecile!</b>

19:30.290 --> 19:32.750
<b>You will regret this!</b>

19:38.920 --> 19:40.450
<b>Blade...</b>

19:44.010 --> 19:45.950
<b>Time for round 2.</b>

19:46.430 --> 19:47.470
<b>Take your shot.</b>

19:48.020 --> 19:49.430
<b>Not gonna help, though.</b>

19:50.600 --> 19:51.690
<b>Goddammit...</b>

19:53.060 --> 19:55.610
<b>You're all freaks...</b>

19:56.860 --> 19:58.480
<b>It's not fair!</b>

19:59.320 --> 20:00.610
<b>Your head...</b>

20:00.610 --> 20:02.660
<b>give me your heads!</b>

20:02.660 --> 20:07.450
<b>I'm going to get out of this rotten town,
and show them all!</b>

20:12.540 --> 20:15.040
<b>Up in the Dragon Palace...</b>

20:30.600 --> 20:32.440
<b>Team-up's over, bub.</b>

20:33.190 --> 20:34.730
<b>I'm going after A.I.M.</b>

20:35.360 --> 20:37.440
<b>Sorry for dragging you into this.</b>

20:37.440 --> 20:38.780
<b>Watch yourself.</b>

20:39.230 --> 20:40.240
<b>You too, girlie.</b>

20:41.030 --> 20:42.780
<b>Razor, look after 'em.</b>

20:43.570 --> 20:47.780
<b>Vampires ain't really my field of expertise,
so I dunno the details, but...</b>

20:48.490 --> 20:51.500
<b>I've heard some weird rumors
coming outta Vietnam.</b>

20:52.250 --> 20:53.290
<b>Got it.</b>

20:54.170 --> 20:55.330
<b>I'll look into it.</b>

20:55.790 --> 20:57.130
<b>One more thing...</b>

20:57.130 --> 21:02.050
<b>Existence has hired a mutant
with powers that're a lot like mine.</b>

21:02.920 --> 21:05.010
<b>Watch yourself if you run into him.</b>

21:05.430 --> 21:06.260
<b>Right.</b>

21:07.600 --> 21:10.560
<b>It's gonna get rough,
but try not to die, bub.</b>

21:11.180 --> 21:12.560
<b>Same to you.</b>

21:13.600 --> 21:15.730
<b>Seeya around, Daywalker.</b>

21:16.770 --> 21:18.980
<b>Bye for now, mutant.</b>

23:04.250 --> 23:06.920
<b>Looks like Logan's info was right...</b>

23:07.550 --> 23:11.050
<b>but I didn't expect we'd
end up being hunted.</b>

23:13.180 --> 23:14.390
<b>I'm a vampire.</b>

23:15.350 --> 23:16.970
<b>Go ahead and kill me if you want.</b>

23:18.140 --> 23:18.890
<b>Daddy...</b>

23:19.810 --> 23:21.150
<b>where are you going?</b>

23:25.110 --> 23:31.070
<i><b>Apocalypse Forever</b></i>

23:25.530 --> 23:29.700
<b>Next time on Blade: Apocalypse Forever.</b>
